<section class="section section--soft" aria-labelledby="ck-h">
  <div class="wrap ck">
    <h2 id="ck-h">Before you call: three quick checks</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Thermostat</strong> on Cool, below room temperature, with fresh batteries</li>
      <li><strong>Breaker and outdoor switch</strong> both on</li>
      <li><strong>Filter</strong> clean enough to see light through</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Still warm? <a href="/guides/ac-not-cooling-checklist">The full six-step checklist</a>, including when to switch it off.</p>
  </div>
</section>

